sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as 设备页面
    participant C as Controller
    participant S as Service
    participant A as CampusAccess
    participant P as CampusDataProvider
    UI->>C: GET /campus/devices
    C->>S: 请求设备列表
    S->>A: 校验当前身份及读取资格
    A-->>S: 允许
    S->>P: 读取教学设备
    P-->>S: 原始设备记录
    S->>S: 核对类型并映射 DTO
    S-->>C: items 与 observedAt
    C-->>UI: code、message、data
